िटोन सब्सट्रेट और मिथेनॉल स्टोइकियोमेट्रिक मात्रा में"},{"identifier":"C","content":"प्रोपैनल सब्सट्रेट और मिथेनॉल अधिकता में"},{"identifier":"D","content":"एसिटोन सब्सट्रेट और मिथेनॉल अधिकता में"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"nloFDKC2WEfANEZUek76g","permalink":"in-the-following-reaction-rate-of-the-reaction-is-the-highe-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-gbrbwibbb8ytutcl","updated_time":1566488027,"timeAllotted":120000,"paperId":"jee-main-2019-online-9th-april-evening-slot","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"topic":"chemical-reactions-for-aldehydes-and-ketones","isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2019-online-9th-april-evening-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","chapter":"p-block-elements","year":2019,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th April Evening Slot","marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"easy","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2019-04-09 14:30","question":{"en":{"content":"The correct statements among I to III regarding\ngroup 13 element oxides are,<br>\n(I) Boron trioxide is acidic.<br>\n(II) Oxides of aluminium and gallium are\namphoteric.<br>\n(III) Oxides of indium and thalliumare basic.","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"(II) and (III) only"},{"identifier":"B","content":"(I), (II) and (III)"},{"identifier":"C","content":"(I) and (III) only"},{"identifier":"D","content":"(I) and (II) only"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":"B<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> is an acidic oxide.\n<br><br>Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> and Ga<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> are amphoteric oxide.\n<br><br>In<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> and Tl<sub>2</sub>O are basic oxide."},"hi":{"content":"समूह 13 तत्व ऑक्साइडों के संबंध में I से III तक सही कथनों में,<br>\n(I) बोरॉन ट्राईऑक्साइड अम्लीय है।<br>\n(II) एल्युमिनियम और गैलियम के ऑ