1\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> = 0.05 mole of Ni is deposited at the cathode."},"hi":{"content":"Ni(NO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub> का एक घोल प्लेटिनम इलेक्ट्रोड्स के बीच 0.1 फैराडे विद्युत धारा का उपयोग करके विद्युत अपघटन किया जाता है। निकल के कितने मोल अवशेष कैथोड पर जमा होंगे?","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"0.10"},{"identifier":"B","content":"0.15"},{"identifier":"C","content":"0.20"},{"identifier":"D","content":"0.05"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"mSgr7enqEwoMXtcYZZlWu","permalink":"a-solution-of-nino32-is-electrolysed-between-platinum-elec-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-qavqyekadh2tzsed","updated_time":1566508887,"timeAllotted":120000,"paperId":"jee-main-2019-online-9th-april-evening-slot","topic":"conductance-and-electrolysis","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2019-online-9th-april-evening-slot","active":true}],"ids":["MdVelIX6HfOOQO1NDE66Q","nloFDKC2WEfANEZUek76g","YNKUz0vHr32WvL7ebJTXB","mSgr7enqEwoMXtcYZZlWu"],"title":"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 9th April Evening Slot | JEE Main Year Wise Previous Years Questions","canonical":"https://app/past-years/jee/which-of-the-following-potential-energy-pe-diagrams-repres-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-rtfmcfjnxzkpuuo2"}